Dear Hiring Team,

I am excited to apply for the *Software Engineer, Early Career* position at *Roblox*. I bring more than three years of professional software engineering experience, an MS in Computer Science from Pace University, and hands-on experience designing, coding, testing, and deploying production features. Most recently, I built a Python and FastAPI distributed systems platform that routes requests across 40+ specialized agents for 10,000+ users, pairing large language models (LLMs) with tenant-aware access control and production safeguards.

My work at Sperse closely matches Roblox's emphasis on the full development lifecycle and experimentation with machine learning frameworks. I investigated LlamaIndex, OpenAI embeddings, and Pgvector to build a grounded RAG service, delivered a TypeScript and React Flow workflow product with durable Temporal execution and Redis-backed live status, and built a FastMCP service exposing 160+ validated backend actions. I also contributed through architectural discussions and code reviews while shipping CI/CD evaluations for latency, accuracy, and safety. These projects required me to adapt quickly in ambiguous environments and turn emerging technology into cohesive, reliable features.

At Qualitest, I designed and deployed a Java and Spring Boot storage service spanning Google Cloud Storage, S3, and MinIO, then improved production data workflows with PostgreSQL and Redis. I also worked with business stakeholders to deliver React visualizations and strengthened error recovery across 100K+ weekly AWS Step Functions and Lambda executions. That experience taught me to connect system design decisions with user and stakeholder needs—the same cross-functional discipline required to partner with Design, Product, Data, QA, and DevOps at Roblox.

Roblox's mission to connect a billion people with optimism and civility is compelling to me, as are its values of respecting the community and taking the long view. I would welcome the opportunity to help evolve Roblox's distributed systems and build innovative features that improve experiences for its global community. I can be reached at #ph or #eml. Thank you for your time and consideration.

